[{"title":"春行","author":"玄烨","text":"爱此融融养育多，平原高下识恩波。\n虽然迅速春难住，四季何尝离太和。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37343,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳絮","author":"玄烨","text":"御苑春将尽，和风鼓物生。\n芸窗来淑气，丹陛奏清声。\n眠柳垂青?，流莺啭碧泓。\n沾泥非有意，高下点蓬瀛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37344,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清潭","author":"玄烨","text":"一潭清冷拂游尘，活水源头可问津。\n静处定知无复浪，动时须认养潜鳞。\n临流能解薰风意，对景先愁涝雨频。\n云影波光相映处，湛然澄澈见天真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37345,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读朱子全书有感而作","author":"玄烨","text":"降衷天命同仁性，气质多偏亦有全。\n人十已千知自勉，参三列九授师传。\n直方表里须涵养，朝夕云为在惕乾。\n喻道程朱明尽善，正心穷理溯渊渊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37346,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暑将退","author":"玄烨","text":"歊蒸少退解烦忧，白发苍颜万里愁。\n触物方知开造化，閒来更觉有源流。\n倒垂树影河边水，悬挂波声岸上楼。\n分外并无着意处，惟将周易静中求。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37347,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浙闽总督范时崇陛见来京朕每念祖为开创宰辅父乃忠义名臣所以待之优重今因回任特书御诗饯送","author":"玄烨","text":"翼唐九佐开天命，论道三台识国桢。\n握管表章文学馆，持忠坚保岁寒名。\n栋梁祖干家声重，兰桂孙枝令誉清。\n浙闽封疆慎抚育，惟期宁静勉精诚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37348,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古北口提督马进良以年老辞去朕念当日鹰扬百战挽强执锐自守紫塞内外恬静皆因宿将老成之所致今回林泉深所惜也故赋五言特记不忘疆场旧事也","author":"玄烨","text":"勇贯先锋气，鹰扬后阵威。\n秦关提宝剑，沙碛历天旗。\n白发秋霜肃，丹心皎日辉。\n饯饮军民别，恩崇赐御衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37349,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得万壑泉消夏千峰翠作秋","author":"玄烨","text":"白藏新素节，碧涧洗心泉。\n爽籁鸣楸叶，纤云罩野田。\n鸿飞横峻岭，鹤舞爱平川。\n见雨心愁潦，闻旸意省愆。\n西成登瑞谷，南亩庆丰年。\n远近无殊别，盈虚有后先。\n桑榆怀壮志，吟咏借瑶篇。\n生理随时发，渊衷重体乾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37350,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"大西门升八旗官阅骑射作","author":"玄烨","text":"骑射为观德，从来旧制存。\n久安惜将老，长治厌兵繁。\n训练虽成法，忠贞实本原。\n先知亲上义，不必问私恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37351,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江南诸臣","author":"玄烨","text":"廿载安澜自有因，河干临幸至于频。\n白首常思善后策，青畴每念力农晨。\n移风实赖封疆吏，化俗无劳专事臣。\n吴越山川犹在目，虽忘多景不忘民。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37352,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"灵泉启文明","author":"玄烨","text":"节应黄钟律，阳生复卦前。\n烈风催短鬓，暖溜益稀年。\n梅候宫中树，诗成几上笺。\n乾坤先后画，至理在精研。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37353,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得恩光日边来","author":"玄烨","text":"冬藏待春发，艮止佐东生。\n八极分仁政，诸方拱向明。\n车书同内外，民物望丰亨。\n敬奉无私义，殷勤宵旰情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37354,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十三年冬至斋戒作","author":"玄烨","text":"姤复生生已浑同，不因小往大来中。\n箫韶如在精诚致，钟鼓云乎礼乐崇。\n日月无私能广运，圣贤有教佐天功。\n老年岂惜衰残力，强欲躬行尽㓗衷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37355,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十三年冬旱十二月初二日大雪二十一日又雪途中偶成","author":"玄烨","text":"玉花泱漭近春和，步辇平明回陌过。\n村老凭门吟里曲，行人载道咏寒歌。\n无尘远视山横塞，破冻齐驱马渡河。\n盈尺王畿皆作瑞，龙沙惟虑雪霜多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37356,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得梅候宫中树","author":"玄烨","text":"积雪梅犹冷，春寒竹色沉。\n占年勤远虑，恶酒自高吟。\n忧乐同民切，诗书味道深。\n光风来锦甸，生养见天心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37357,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得三十六宫都是春","author":"玄烨","text":"四时观物视韦篇，奥旨微言开画前。\n月窟天根来往处，地雷乾巽互环旋。\n青阳和煦为春首，淑日依迟作道筌。\n运转洪钧推造化，体元善政在身先。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37358,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"日月无私能广运","author":"玄烨","text":"春寒暗解消冰势，膏澍新添助发生。\n绣壤已看随处润，柴扉共乐及时耕。\n运筹普被群黎广，宵旰先思积粟盈。\n每览前村童叟悦，枫宸少慰白须情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37359,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日郊行示地方官 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"警跸幸畿南，中和慰闾里。\n千村静路尘，淑气遍远迩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37360,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日郊行示地方官 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"每春来此地，黎庶尽安康。\n尚德先宽政，官僚勉直方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37361,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日郊行示地方官 其三","author":"玄烨","text":"春蒐省耕种，莫误农桑时。\n假寐羹墙睹，殷勤意在兹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37362,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日郊行示地方官 其四","author":"玄烨","text":"牧民寄所重，授钺赖宣风。\n曩昔官箴在，开诚上下同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37363,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日郊行示地方官 其五","author":"玄烨","text":"平成多历年，生齿既蕃庶。\n惟食在天时，轻徭民自豫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37364,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日郊行示地方官 其六","author":"玄烨","text":"案读五经义，遐观四海图。\n缅怀洙泗训，期共乐天衢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37365,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟中鼓琴","author":"玄烨","text":"蓬窗听绿绮，月影映船遥。\n静里宫商别，风前律吕调。\n雁飞遥集渚，鱼跃欲乘潮。\n雨歇苔犹湿，应知助麦苗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37366,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和风细雨","author":"玄烨","text":"春潭连霢霂，沙岸泊轻舟。\n鸭绿苔痕静，人閒载酒游。\n风帆通野望，雨气杂清流。\n怀保先农事，观耕凤跸留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37367,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望湖春色 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"极目平波心水同，烟添媚景日曈昽。\n湖边淑色年年有，似我澄怀数省躬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37368,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望湖春色 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"倚槛平明对草庐，溪滨来往隐樵渔。\n虽然九五乘乾位，山水幽情自卷舒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37369,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟中观耕种","author":"玄烨","text":"四野春耕阡陌安，徐牵密缆望河干。\n土肥原系黄沙过，辛苦先年挽异澜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37370,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春归","author":"玄烨","text":"勿讶春归速，还因冷觉迟。\n烟寒榆荚落，雨逐柳黄移。\n惜景勤经学，怡情喜恊时。\n惠风虽曰尽，长养已相随。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37371,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南方青竹丛林不乏观玩北地气寒非保护得宜即难艺植朕尝有事河干往来数次览竹树之畅茂暂时停辇即行后于禁苑种植颇蕃今经三十馀年迩来延至数亩之广其围至八寸径二寸五分有零古人以竹比君子因而思及草木无知积小以至于高大人有血气加之培养岂非国家桢干之选欤故赋七言一律记之","author":"玄烨","text":"培养丛篁多历年，竹窗抱节绿云鲜。\n猗猗玉润歌君子，济济心虚忆俊贤。\n可爱缤纷含宿雨，最宜潇洒动新烟。\n馀春欲伴寒松住，渐晚韶光被景牵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37372,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十四年仲夏避暑途中瑞麦盈野赋五言律以记","author":"玄烨","text":"忽送清尘雨，题诗吮兔毫。\n青黄接玉粒，霢霂佐琼膏。\n入野农歌遍，缘溪牧笛高。\n蔚林能解愠，密草满亭皋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37373,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"每见村农野老不识不知天然自得孝弟发于至性朴诚不事文辞故美其实而取先进之意赋七言一律","author":"玄烨","text":"昼夜徬徨利禄间，奚如鄙里野人閒。\n诗书不解穷通事，名姓无闻士宦班。\n孔颜乐处箪瓢在，孝弟真情稚子关。\n可笑文章少实据，空将浮伪玷青纶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37374,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天 擎盖荷珠","author":"玄烨","text":"数亩芳塘花未开。\n荷珠清露落莓苔。\n雨凉翡翠摇歌扇，风弄蜻蜓逐水隈。\n乳燕舞，晓莺来。\n炎天还似未春回。\n葛衣日暮丝丝冷，丹槛泉声处处催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37375,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后戏题回文诗","author":"玄烨","text":"云收晓景霁烟开，曲槛香凝露染苔。\n分径花光清气爽，纷纷雨思绮文裁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37376,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"佛手柑","author":"玄烨","text":"生绿熟黄却有因，清香闽峤共呈珍。\n似开贝叶瞿昙手，妙合华阴仙掌垠。\n异物不须传驿路，奇芬欣得近枫宸。\n画图尺素分枝干，相对无烦忆海滨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37377,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得江城五月落梅花","author":"玄烨","text":"梅花一调楚江干，吹彻潇湘五月寒。\n地北天南无谪叟，不教羁思入毫端。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37378,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"芝径云堤细雨归舟","author":"玄烨","text":"长堤一线入芝径，小艇乘凉隔岸移。\n水向方桥潆细浪，风吹菡萏倒垂枝。\n秋成已庆年丰兆，暑尽无忧云汉诗。\n遗事陈瓜为七夕，偶因佳节赋清辞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37379,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题兰","author":"玄烨","text":"君子之道，闇然日章。\n蕙兰之质，有风则香。\n草木培植，格物知详。\n飞潜动静，各有攸藏。\n秉精天地，青紫芬芳。\n产自松岛，移根草堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37380,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏剪秋罗","author":"玄烨","text":"可惜轻罗任剪裁，名传南国向秋开。\n未知紫塞多佳种，杂置嫣红配绿苔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37381,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"饯大学士李光地暂回闽省","author":"玄烨","text":"恊恭惟得老成儒，味道经书翊庙谟。\n白发辞君千里去，丹心捧日寸诚敷。\n秋霜昔岁明臣节，昆玉冲襟决胜符。\n暂别恩荣宸翰饯，勿劳远念慰长途。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37382,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋幸出郊见收成志喜 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"节届商秋早，农忙屡岁丰。\n柴门歌再稔，比屋乐同风。\n人烟多庆色，霜树杂微红。\n极目高低景，山川一望中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37383,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋幸出郊见收成志喜 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"涤暑高风至，中分白露微。\n草肥宜牧马，林薄好行围。\n水向阶前注，峰排云外稀。\n斜阳临帐殿，晚色秘天机。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37384,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得帐殿郁崔嵬 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"茂林叶未黄，宾雁始成行。\n后队分山出，前旌越岭扬。\n鹿鸣秋草盛，人喜菊花香。\n日暮帷宫近，风高暑气藏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37385,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得帐殿郁崔嵬 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"清露知时转，纤云却暑回。\n豫游临石磴，杂踏过河隈。\n潭静鱼吹沫，林疏鹿印苔。\n秋成良可赋，为此共徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37386,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"康熙五十四年十月初三日避暑山庄恭祝皇太后万寿诗","author":"玄烨","text":"诞值小春暖，承颜爱日长。\n农閒歌乐土，臣喜拜山堂。\n孟月祈年节，芳卮献寿觞。\n南峰留翠盖，北斗灿珠行。\n愉色常犹怯，怡声久未忘。\n欢心依白发，福曜现青方。\n至养慈闱庆，遐龄母德昌。\n虚文岂作颂，人瑞纪篇章。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37387,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日可爱","author":"玄烨","text":"秋敛冬藏暗发生，循环潜应有馀情。\n扶阳布序君人志，爱日书云宇宙明。\n长至免行丹陛礼，融风不设玉厨羹。\n化醇意切惭凉德，渐喜春和万物荣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37388,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜偶成 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"隆冬何必辟寒犀，惟有苍颜性不迷。\n玉律回环新故接，釭花夜永卷中题。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37389,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜偶成 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"安危最系在君心，待旦殷勤化理寻。\n鹤发多愁犹警惕，长思时弊若临深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37390,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"季冬汤泉","author":"玄烨","text":"素雪满川山未露，霜林盈野日将斜。\n祈年正喜逢长至，澡德非同玩物华。\n秉烛检书冬夕永，爇香待旦画屏遮。\n灵泉每助消寒效，总为纯阳辨正邪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37391,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十四年除夕偶成","author":"玄烨","text":"待曙迎新节，辞寒忆旧时。\n风光忽瞬息，岁月急星驰。\n少小劳宵旰，中年按古规。\n精力虽云惫，衷肠坚不移。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37392,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"康熙五十五年正月元旦书怀","author":"玄烨","text":"乍回斗柄又芳晨，端月元阳万象新。\n竹叶向风消积雪，梅花除腊报初春。\n彤庭启节迎祥始，邃阁兴文起草频。\n每绎晦翁真乐处，早知天意即生民。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37393,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上元前三日立春","author":"玄烨","text":"腊寒犹接上元灯，窗外参差六出凝。\n媚景新春催玉律，惠风活水破蛟冰。\n殷勤祈谷宁辞瘁，勉强雕虫愧未能。\n九陌人烟多喜色，千门比户望年登。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37394,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十五年正月十二癸卯立春是日风从东北而至景云密布瑞雪铺地至十三日未止书云立春与元日同占乃收成之兆故喜民有足食之庆朕慰宵旰之忧赋五言排律以记其事","author":"玄烨","text":"问夜何尝歇，殷勤六十年。\n岁华催短鬓，寸晷惜担肩。\n丰歉无推数，平成在事先。\n人安为国瑞，谷熟是民天。\n惭抚陶甄治，思将法令蠲。\n云浓春气早，风静漏声传。\n南陌银花遍，东郊绣壤连。\n管弦喧里巷，灯火接山川。\n不为私情扰，宁耽宝馔延。\n祗期民俗厚，敢诩治功全。\n礼让传家教，诗书戒往愆。\n翠烟笼畎亩，泛泛润桑田。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37395,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春寒梅迟","author":"玄烨","text":"化工节候递推移，长养生生雨露垂。\n雪冷梅惊频吐萼，春迟柳怯未飏丝。\n阳禽北向还应早，林雀群争若有知。\n和气停云今夕晚，走桥明月赋新词。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37396,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"汤泉道上遇雪口占","author":"玄烨","text":"种麦田间盼尺盈，牧羊沙漠恶飘霙。\n王臣率土分忧乐，莫道天公有不平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37397,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春风扇微和 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"雪消山露背，泉暖日暄波。\n荡涤甘言疾，澄清无妄疴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37398,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春风扇微和 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"淑气来春甸，和风慰悯农。\n东郊滋土润，云尽显诸峰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37399,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题朱伦瀚手指画雪梅竹二首 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"指端写出犯寒梅，老干单枝雪里培。\n疑是江南春色晚，红芳遍野点青苔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37400,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题朱伦瀚手指画雪梅竹二首 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"雪覆石林竹，时催腊尽梅。\n閒云飘远岫，长对翠屏开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37401,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"两广总督赵宏灿陛见来京","author":"玄烨","text":"镇抚封疆多历年，滇黔百粤凯归鞯。\n当时马革抒诚切，近日龙光锡庆绵。\n万里宣风梅岭表，三台拥节桂江边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37402,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"优隆主眷酬耆旧芸阁宸章赐绮筵赋得二月春风似剪刀","author":"玄烨","text":"春居别墅少人喧，煦育深知造化恩。\n雪净梅花舒绿萼，霜轻柳带拂朱垣。\n和风宇宙严寒解，暖日亭皋物色繁。\n无欲自然得静理，丹颜已过白须存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37403,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日即事","author":"玄烨","text":"最盛芳春育物多，仲阳孳茂野烟和。\n岂辞宵旰求民隐，益守平成免赋苛。\n望杏敦耕迎淑气，瞻蒲劝稼播嘉禾。\n中畴社鼓声相应，敷惠元元载路歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37404,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓发芦沟","author":"玄烨","text":"有闰春深淑景迟，长桥冰泮未流澌。\n徘徊风景思畴昔，千里金堤保旧规。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37405,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"六里桥铁柱","author":"玄烨","text":"镕垆铸冶镇桥西，往返行人旧迹迷。\n世远传殊谁识得，天南铜柱想应齐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37406,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水村","author":"玄烨","text":"曾记江淮泊万艘，便旋水淀暂春游。\n虽无浩渺长波壮，亦有清漪锦浪浮。\n日暮帆樯排远岸，风轻蓑笠聚芳洲。\n乡村不识居官况，漫笑朝堂身世忧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37407,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春水满四泽","author":"玄烨","text":"条风拂春水，碧涨绕烟岑。\n梅萼先知暖，林梢渐覆阴。\n柳舒鸣好鸟，渚静习时禽。\n韶景融和处，潜窥造化心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37408,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟中观猎","author":"玄烨","text":"习战昆明汉武穿，于今江海靖鲸烟。\n常思远涉坚筋骨，每令平流演猎船。\n雁阵惊鎗离复合，鸥群畏弩?还连。\n衰年虽乏挽强力，黾勉春蒐以德先。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37409,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]